    <!-- ============ SECTION 17 – GLOSSARY ============ -->
    <div class="section-header" id="s17"><span class="num">17</span><h2>Quick-Reference Glossary</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="three-col">
      <div class="card cn">
        <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Provision</div><div class="glossary-def">A liability of uncertain timing or amount.</div></div>
        <div class="glossary-item" style="border-bottom:none;"><div class="glossary-term">Contingent liability</div><div class="glossary-def">A possible or unrecognized present obligation dependent on uncertain future events, or one lacking a reliable estimate.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card cn">
        <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Contingent asset</div><div class="glossary-def">A possible asset arising from past events, confirmed only by uncertain future events outside the entity's control.</div></div>
        <div class="glossary-item" style="border-bottom:none;"><div class="glossary-term">Onerous contract</div><div class="glossary-def">A contract where unavoidable costs of meeting obligations exceed the expected economic benefits or service potential.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card cn">
        <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Restructuring</div><div class="glossary-def">A planned, management-controlled program materially changing the scope or manner of an entity's activities.</div></div>
        <div class="glossary-item" style="border-bottom:none;"><div class="glossary-term">Collective services</div><div class="glossary-def">Services provided simultaneously to the whole community, addressing society's needs as a whole – no provision is recognized for these.</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

